!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/schema/invalid/an-identifier-member-outside-the-grammar-expected.tn"
!!schema:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/schema-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §7.4, [TSON-DATA] §7.7"
  description: """
    The members rule over an identifier family: every member satisfies the facets beside it, and the
    identifier grammar is one of them. `2nd` begins with a digit, so no value can ever be that member --
    a value is refused by the grammar before the member set is asked -- and the body is refused when the
    schema loads rather than admitting a member it can never reach.
    """
  meta: "meta.tn"
  import: ["core.tn"]
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
